[02:10.38] Shape is still
[02:11.27] Asleep
[02:13.05] With the toys
[02:18.40] As tall as men
[02:20.33] The pictures in the hallway
[02:22.14] Turning inside
[02:25.77] Whispers
[02:26.69] Unseen
[02:28.48] Jumping against the sky
[02:33.80] Slipping away
[02:38.39] He looks
[02:39.26] For the last time...
